-t=\"18y\\sqrt5-8y\\sqrt{105}\"></span>","o":""},{"n":"19","s":[["\\frac{\\sqrt7}{3+\\sqrt5}\\times\\frac{3-\\sqrt5}{3-\\sqrt5}","بضرب البسط والمقام في مرافق المقام"],["=\\frac{3\\sqrt7-\\sqrt{35}}{9-5}=\\frac{3\\sqrt7-\\sqrt{35}}{4}","بالتبسيط"]],"a":"<span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"\\frac{3\\sqrt7-\\sqrt{35}}{4}\"></span>","o":""},{"n":"20","s":[["\\frac{1}{1-\\sqrt3}\\times\\frac{1+\\sqrt3}{1+\\sqrt3}","بضرب البسط والمقام في مرافق المقام"],["=\\frac{1+\\sqrt3}{1-3}=-\\frac{1+\\sqrt3}{2}","بالتبسيط"]],"a":"<span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"-\\frac{1+\\sqrt3}{2}\"></span>","o":""},{"n":"21","s":[["\\frac{1-2\\sqrt x}{3+\\sqrt x}\\times\\frac{3-\\sqrt x}{3-\\sqrt x}","بضرب البسط والمقام في مرافق المقام"],["=\\frac{3-\\sqrt x-6\\sqrt x+2x}{9-x}","خاصية التوزيع"],["=\\frac{2x-7\\sqrt x+3}{9-x}","بالتبسيط"]],"a":"<span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"\\frac{2x-7\\sqrt x+3}{9-x}\"></span> حيث <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"x\\ne9\"></span>","o":""}],[{"n":"22","s":[["(5+\\sqrt2)(5-\\sqrt2)=25-2","الخطأ: حاصل ضرب المترافقين <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"a^2-b^2\"></span> وليس <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"a^2+b^2\"></span>"],["\\frac{1}{5+\\sqrt2}=\\frac{5-\\sqrt2}{25-2}=\\frac{5-\\sqrt2}{23}","التصحيح"]],"a":"الناتج الصحيح <span class=\"tx\" data-t=\"\\frac{5-\\sqrt2}{23}\"></span>","o":""}]]